          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="40" width="40" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path fill="#c68335" d="M47.6 300.4L228.3 469.1c7.5 7 17.4 10.9 27.7 10.9s20.2-3.9 27.7-10.9L464.4 300.4c30.4-28.3 47.6-68 47.6-109.5v-5.8c0-69.9-50.5-129.5-119.4-141C347 36.5 300.6 51.4 268 84L256 96 244 84c-32.6-32.6-79-47.5-124.6-39.9C50.5 55.6 0 115.2 0 185.1v5.8c0 41.5 17.2 81.2 47.6 109.5z"/></svg>
          <h5>Twój azyl w sercu Spisza</h5>
          <h1>Janicka Chata</h1>
